(7)=5.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we can write $96=qn+r$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}96={{13}_{⏟}}_{q}\\cdot 7+{{5}_{⏟}}_{r}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, $q\\cdot r=13\\cdot 5=65.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-c18fdade-b31d-500c-9ac3-fe7da34b2f8c"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-c18fdade-b31d-500c-9ac3-fe7da34b2f8c" :answer-field/id #uuid "c18fdade-b31d-500c-9ac3-fe7da34b2f8c" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-e7b9af20-0a99-555f-b6b6-cfee6fdc21ec" :answer-field/choices ["answer-36317481-1088-5e8c-b158-b7dcd8b8b247" "answer-8bd19f6f-413a-5e4e-8d62-fbfad83beb5d" "answer-c3fe947f-b82a-57f4-b35e-9a3dce8041f2" "answer-7b9fa351-8ded-5346-be31-b4ff2b2b4c28" "answer-e7b9af20-0a99-555f-b6b6-cfee6fdc21ec"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-36317481-1088-5e8c-b158-b7dcd8b8b247" :answer/id #uuid "36317481-1088-5e8c-b158-b7dcd8b8b247" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "13" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-8bd19f6f-413a-5e4e-8d62-fbfad83beb5d" :answer/id #uuid "8bd19f6f-413a-5e4e-8d62-fbfad83beb5d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "15" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-c3fe947f-b82a-57f4-b35e-9a3dce8041f2" :answer/id #uuid "c3fe947f-b82a-57f4-b35e-9a3dce8041f2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "26" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-7b9fa351-8ded-5346-be31-b4ff2b2b4c28" :answer/id #uuid "7b9fa351-8ded-5346-be31-b4ff2b2b4c28" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "35" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-e7b9af20-0a99-555f-b6b6-cfee6fdc21ec" :answer/id #uuid "e7b9af20-0a99-555f-b6b6-cfee6fdc21ec" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "65" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186152768 :question/problem "Let $a=-50$ and $n=7.$ Find integers $q$ and $r$ such that $a=qn+r,$ where $0\\le r<n,$ and determine $q\\cdot r.$" :question/worked-solution "Dividing $-50$ by $7$ using integer division, we notice that\n\n$$\n-8<-50÷7<-7.\n$$\n\nThe quotient $q$ is the left-hand value. So $q=-8.$\n\nNext, we find the remainder $r$ by solving $r=a-qn.$ This gives\n\n$$\nr=-50-(-8)(7)=6.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we can write $-50=qn+r$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-50={{(-8)}_{⏟}}_{q}\\cdot 7+{{6}_{⏟}}_{r}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, $q\\cdot r=-8\\cdot 6=-48.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-4e37f64a-8998-5449-aecb-21ffa6619590"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-4e37f64a-8998-5449-aecb-21ffa6619590" :answer-field/id #uuid "4e37f64a-8998-5449-aecb-21ffa6619590" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-c04b00aa-a695-5faf-95e5-09c780d0b550" :answer-field/choices ["answer-823d3451-6c3b-5ffe-b464-25dc82c5cfb7" "answer-c04b00aa-a695-5faf-95e5-09c780d0b550" "answer-a8daefe9-bdbf-5a34-a0f9-f64318fa45ca" "answer-50c3e5f9-2c93-57fb-b875-e38a0121ca38" "answer-5ad4bf42-db77-582e-84d7-cccfdf1a020a"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-823d3451-6c3b-5ffe-b464-25dc82c5cfb7" :answer/id #uuid "823d3451-6c3b-5ffe-b464-25dc82c5cfb7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-35" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-c04b00aa-a695-5faf-95e5-09c780d0b550" :answer/id #uuid "c04b00aa-a695-5faf-95e5-09c780d0b550" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-48" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-a8daefe9-bdbf-5a34-a0f9-f64318fa45ca" :answer/id #uuid "a8daefe9-bdbf-5a34-a0f9-f64318fa45ca" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-7" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-50c3e5f9-2c93-57fb-b875-e38a0121ca38" :answer/id #uuid "50c3e5f9-2c93-57fb-b875-e38a0121ca38" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-5ad4bf42-db77-582e-84d7-cccfdf1a020a" :answer/id #uuid "5a